ader pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F12.20.8834\">12.20.8834</a><br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 29, 2019<br/>Summer Update 2019</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20190701193850&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/The_Regalia_of_Suon_85c281.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  the Regalia of Suon.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 34.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">A golden sun medal is attached to a silken cordon and soldered on a sunray emblem with a bijou.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Item used to tame a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Gryphon (Mount)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gryphon_Mount_65eb36.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Gryphon\">Gryphon</a> while wearing a <a href=\"#/wiki/Gryphon%20Mask\">Gryphon Mask</a>.\n</p><p>Failed: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\">The gryphon flew off.</span><br/>\nFailed: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\">The gryphon rejects your gift.</span><br/>\nSucceeded: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\">The gryphon will now accompany you as a friend and ally.</span>\n</p><p>This item can be assembled from its four pieces:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20and%20Golden%20Cordon\"><img alt=\"Blue and Golden Cordon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blue_and_Golden_Cordon_673fe5.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20and%20Golden%20Cordon\">Blue and Golden Cordon</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Golden%20Bijou\"><img alt=\"Golden Bijou\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Golden_Bijou_35038b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Golden%20Bijou\">Golden Bijou</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sunray%20Emblem\"><img alt=\"Sunray Emblem\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sunray_Emblem_37835a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Sunray%20Emblem\">Sunray Emblem</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sun%20Medal\"><img alt=\"Sun Medal\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sun_Medal_dd6a62.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Sun%20Medal\">Sun Medal</a></li></ul>\n<p>Its four parts are rewards of the <a href=\"#/quest/kilmaresh-quest\">Kilmaresh Quest</a>. <a href=\"#/wiki/Yonan\">Yonan</a> on the city market can assemble it for you.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20and%20Golden%20Cordon\">Blue and Golden Cordon</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Golden%20Bijou\">Golden Bijou</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gryphon\">Gryphon</a></li><li>Gryphon (Mount)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gryphon%20Mask\">Gryphon Mask</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/kilmaresh-quest\">Kilmaresh Quest</a></li><li>Light Sources</li><li>Quests</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sun%20Medal\">Sun Medal</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sunray%20Emblem\">Sunray Emblem</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Taming%20Items\">Taming Items</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["kilmaresh-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"kilmaresh-quest","quest":"Kilmaresh Quest","step":"9-0","n":89,"title":"Juntar a Regalia of Suon","kind":"reward","coords":[{"x":33922,"y":31513,"z":7,"label":"Yonan"}]}]}}